# SPA fallback - Functions are automatically excluded by Netlify
#
# Old domains forward to the primary domain thepalaciocollection.com (301, path and query string are kept).
# Function URLs (/.netlify/functions/*) are not touched by these rules, so iCal feeds and webhooks keep working on the old addresses.
https://executivevacations.net/*          https://thepalaciocollection.com/:splat  301!
https://www.executivevacations.net/*      https://thepalaciocollection.com/:splat  301!
https://www.paradisevillascostarica.com/*  https://thepalaciocollection.com/:splat  301!

